WEBVTT

00:33.580 --> 00:37.020
=Royal Upstart 2=
(Based on "Zhenguan Foolish Son-in-Law")

00:37.325 --> 00:39.837
=Episode 22=

00:39.885 --> 00:42.600
(Exploding the Great Clans!)

00:55.519 --> 00:56.160
What...

00:56.400 --> 00:57.480
What happened to my door?

01:10.320 --> 01:11.399
Wei Hao...

01:11.879 --> 01:12.839
Cui Xiongkai,

01:13.390 --> 01:16.079
I heard you have a problem
with my marriage to the Eldest Princess.

01:16.079 --> 01:17.200
What are you trying to do?

01:17.600 --> 01:19.359
How dare you attack my home!

01:19.359 --> 01:20.200
Someone, come here!

01:20.439 --> 01:21.200
- Master.
- Master.

01:21.960 --> 01:23.159
Beat him and throw him out!

01:23.640 --> 01:24.119
Get him!

01:24.119 --> 01:25.310
- Yes, Master.
- Yes, Master.

01:34.759 --> 01:35.679
What is this?

01:35.759 --> 01:36.399
Come on.

01:37.079 --> 01:38.240
Try me.

01:38.920 --> 01:41.039
I'll toss this into the crowd
in a moment.

01:41.159 --> 01:42.600
Let's see how many of you survive.

01:42.600 --> 01:43.359
Wei Hao!

01:44.039 --> 01:44.640
What...

01:45.119 --> 01:47.040
What exactly do you want?

01:47.040 --> 01:49.480
So, you have an issue with me
marrying the Eldest Princess,

01:49.920 --> 01:51.280
and you even want to divorce

01:51.359 --> 01:53.680
those women who
married out of the Wei clan?

01:54.519 --> 01:54.959
You...

01:54.959 --> 01:56.000
Is that true or not?

01:57.159 --> 01:59.159
It's clearly you who was wrong first.

01:59.359 --> 02:01.280
All the clans had already agreed

02:01.280 --> 02:03.110
that no one would marry
into the Imperial Family.

02:03.120 --> 02:03.920
You messed up,

02:04.599 --> 02:05.920
and yet you're blaming us?

02:05.920 --> 02:07.519
How exactly did I mess up?

02:08.640 --> 02:10.439
Your agreement is none
of my darn business.

02:11.079 --> 02:12.920
My marriage is none of your concern.

02:13.719 --> 02:15.120
And divorcing our women?

02:15.120 --> 02:16.359
Just try it!

02:20.599 --> 02:22.079
Cui Xiongkai,

02:22.920 --> 02:25.159
listen here.

02:25.319 --> 02:26.439
Within ten days,

02:26.760 --> 02:28.640
have your clan leader

02:28.879 --> 02:30.799
come to the capital to see me.

02:31.200 --> 02:32.560
If he doesn't show up in ten days,

02:32.760 --> 02:33.840
then a month from now,

02:34.120 --> 02:35.719
there will be 100,000

02:35.719 --> 02:38.000
different types of books in the capital.

02:39.799 --> 02:40.640
Let's see,

02:40.840 --> 02:42.120
within ten years,

02:42.920 --> 02:44.719
if I can pull

02:44.760 --> 02:46.239
the great clans up by the roots.

02:46.239 --> 02:47.280
How presumptuous!

02:48.680 --> 02:50.359
Uproot us?

02:50.359 --> 02:51.719
100,000 types of books?

02:51.800 --> 02:53.039
Are you that capable?

02:53.479 --> 02:55.439
Just notify your clan leader.

02:56.000 --> 02:57.759
Whether they come or not
is their choice.

02:58.039 --> 02:58.840
Besides,

02:59.360 --> 03:01.599
if you dare to divorce
even one Wei clan woman,

03:01.600 --> 03:03.060
there will be nothing to talk about.

03:03.120 --> 03:04.840
Just come and buy books in a month.

03:05.159 --> 03:06.120
I guarantee

03:06.280 --> 03:08.039
that I'll have every book

03:08.039 --> 03:09.080
those scholars need.

03:10.000 --> 03:10.800
Wei Hao.

03:13.080 --> 03:14.199
You just wait.

03:15.360 --> 03:16.719
I don't believe for a second

03:17.120 --> 03:18.599
that no one can keep you in check!

03:19.319 --> 03:20.120
All right.

03:20.560 --> 03:21.520
Step aside.

03:21.919 --> 03:23.439
I'm going to blow up your living room

03:23.439 --> 03:24.479
just to give you a warning.

03:24.479 --> 03:25.759
My living room...

03:27.800 --> 03:29.319
What are you all standing around for?

03:29.319 --> 03:30.120
Stop him.

03:30.120 --> 03:30.759
Come on.

03:31.000 --> 03:32.060
Who dares to step forward?

03:34.199 --> 03:35.159
Run.

03:35.319 --> 03:36.159
Let's go, Master.

03:36.520 --> 03:37.199
Run.

03:46.879 --> 03:47.759
Remember.

03:48.400 --> 03:51.199
Within ten days, have your clan leader
come to the capital to see me.

03:52.319 --> 03:53.319
Wei Hao,

03:54.879 --> 03:56.439
I'll fight you to the death!

03:56.439 --> 03:57.159
Come then!

03:57.710 --> 03:59.199
This one is packed with iron filings.

03:59.199 --> 04:00.520
It will blow you to pieces.

04:03.560 --> 04:05.039
You're the ones who forced my hand.

04:05.879 --> 04:06.360
Let's go.

04:06.400 --> 04:07.319
On to the next house.

04:08.039 --> 04:08.840
Wei Hao.

04:09.639 --> 04:11.400
Wei the Fool!

04:16.639 --> 04:17.180
Your Majesty,

04:17.650 --> 04:20.360
this explosion doesn't sound like it came
from the Ministry of Works.

04:20.500 --> 04:22.360
It should be coming
from outside the palace.

04:26.639 --> 04:27.960
Wei the Fool.

04:29.120 --> 04:29.919
Report!

04:30.400 --> 04:33.330
Your Majesty, the Ministry of Works
has not been manufacturing gunpowder.

04:34.090 --> 04:35.879
(The only ones who
know how to use gunpowder)

04:35.879 --> 04:37.840
(are Wei Hao and Cheng Sanfu.)

04:38.280 --> 04:40.639
(But Cheng Sanfu would never
pull a stunt like this.)

04:41.039 --> 04:43.479
(It has to be Wei Hao.)

04:45.240 --> 04:46.330
Send someone to investigate.

04:47.439 --> 04:47.960
No.

04:48.639 --> 04:49.520
Go there yourself.

04:49.840 --> 04:51.120
Change into your plain clothes.

04:52.039 --> 04:52.840
Go and see

04:52.919 --> 04:55.080
if it really is Wei Hao using gunpowder.

04:55.400 --> 04:56.719
If it is indeed Wei Hao,

04:57.080 --> 04:58.319
pretend you didn't see anything

04:58.319 --> 04:59.639
and report back to me.

05:00.839 --> 05:01.920
Yes, Your Majesty.

05:05.480 --> 05:06.319
Wei the Fool,

05:06.360 --> 05:07.199
are you crazy?

05:14.720 --> 05:16.560
Wang Chen, look at yourself now.

05:16.560 --> 05:18.120
Cowering like a turtle in its shell.

05:18.120 --> 05:19.800
You even pushed
your wife in front of you.

05:19.800 --> 05:21.040
You're barely human, aren't you?

05:22.480 --> 05:23.319
It's a fake.

05:28.240 --> 05:29.920
What a humiliation.

05:30.000 --> 05:31.439
In all my decades,

05:31.439 --> 05:33.439
I have never suffered such an insult!

05:35.519 --> 05:36.519
Two things.

05:37.199 --> 05:37.920
First.

05:38.519 --> 05:39.920
If you dare to divorce

05:40.000 --> 05:41.279
the women of the Wei clan,

05:41.839 --> 05:42.720
then soon,

05:42.920 --> 05:44.399
the capital will have

05:44.399 --> 05:46.160
100,000 books for sale every month.

05:46.439 --> 05:47.319
Mark my words.

05:47.680 --> 05:49.319
That's every single month.

05:51.439 --> 05:54.079
Second, have your clan leader
come to the capital

05:54.079 --> 05:55.480
to meet me within ten days.

05:55.639 --> 05:57.480
Whether they come is their business.

05:57.480 --> 05:59.439
You just focus on writing the letter.

05:59.639 --> 06:01.959
At worst, we all go down together.

06:02.639 --> 06:03.480
Wei Hao,

06:03.920 --> 06:05.199
you are too arrogant.

06:05.439 --> 06:06.199
Today,

06:06.199 --> 06:08.240
if you don't kneel and apologize to me,

06:08.240 --> 06:09.439
even if I have
to take this to His Majesty...

06:09.439 --> 06:10.360
Go ahead and sue me.

06:11.720 --> 06:12.519
However,

06:13.560 --> 06:15.439
I brought so many good things today.

06:15.959 --> 06:17.399
It'd be a waste not to use them.

06:17.839 --> 06:19.839
I'll blow you into
a crippled turtle first.

06:20.720 --> 06:21.519
Wait!

06:21.519 --> 06:22.120
I was wrong.

06:22.120 --> 06:22.839
Marquis Wei,

06:22.839 --> 06:23.480
don't light it.

06:26.759 --> 06:27.480
Don't light it.

06:33.399 --> 06:34.199
Marquis,

06:34.319 --> 06:35.279
whatever this is,

06:35.560 --> 06:36.879
we can talk it out.

06:37.360 --> 06:39.199
You and I are both men of status.

06:39.519 --> 06:41.000
This isn't necessary.

06:41.000 --> 06:41.800
Who told you to laugh?

06:41.800 --> 06:43.480
I'm just here to notify you today.

06:45.079 --> 06:47.000
You actually dare to
divorce a Wei woman?

06:47.279 --> 06:49.279
Do you think they have
no family to back them up?

06:50.560 --> 06:51.360
Also,

06:51.959 --> 06:53.319
who I choose to marry

06:53.680 --> 06:54.839
is none of your business.

06:54.839 --> 06:55.759
Does it bother you?

06:57.199 --> 06:58.000
Well...

06:58.959 --> 06:59.839
Marquis Wei,

06:59.839 --> 07:02.360
there must be a deep
misunderstanding between us.

07:02.480 --> 07:03.680
Let wealth

07:03.680 --> 07:04.759
and beautiful women

07:04.759 --> 07:06.600
be my apology to you.

07:06.600 --> 07:07.560
Get out of here.

07:10.279 --> 07:10.839
Well,

07:10.839 --> 07:11.720
Marquis Wei,

07:11.879 --> 07:12.600
look,

07:12.600 --> 07:14.040
so many people are watching me.

07:14.040 --> 07:15.079
Give me some face.

07:15.079 --> 07:16.690
I'm in a hurry to get to the next house.

07:17.040 --> 07:18.959
Did you remember what I just said?

07:19.560 --> 07:20.519
Of course.

07:21.319 --> 07:22.000
Let's go.

07:40.399 --> 07:42.639
Darn it!

07:50.079 --> 07:52.560
This deadlock
is impossible to break now.

07:53.720 --> 07:54.680
Good heavens.

07:55.000 --> 07:57.879
How could the Wei clan
produce such a creature?

07:58.360 --> 08:00.319
He even blew up their mansions.

08:00.759 --> 08:03.759
How am I supposed
to explain this to them?

08:04.040 --> 08:05.040
Clan Leader!

08:05.839 --> 08:07.040
Clan Leader, this is bad.

08:07.319 --> 08:08.120
Wei Hao

08:08.560 --> 08:10.600
has blown up the mansions
of many great clans.

08:10.720 --> 08:11.199
His...

08:11.560 --> 08:14.040
His carriage is heading straight for us.

08:14.040 --> 08:16.319
What is Wei the Fool doing here?

08:17.279 --> 08:18.079
Quick.

08:18.240 --> 08:19.680
Open the main gate!

08:19.879 --> 08:20.680
Now!

08:20.680 --> 08:21.519
Open the main gate!

08:21.519 --> 08:22.160
Hurry.

08:23.175 --> 08:23.937
(Wei Ancestral Home)

08:25.560 --> 08:26.680
Wei the Fool,

08:27.720 --> 08:28.680
are you crazy?

08:29.319 --> 08:31.199
You're even bombing
the Wei ancestral home?

08:31.360 --> 08:33.720
I haven't even provoked you lately.

08:34.519 --> 08:35.360
Marquis Wei,

08:35.439 --> 08:36.720
we are all part of the same clan.

08:36.720 --> 08:38.480
Is there any need for such a bombing?

08:39.240 --> 08:40.120
What do you know?

08:40.480 --> 08:41.160
Clan Leader,

08:41.360 --> 08:42.759
I am actually helping you.

08:42.760 --> 08:45.200
I've already blown up
the main gates of all the other clans.

08:45.279 --> 08:46.279
If yours isn't blown up,

08:46.279 --> 08:47.690
won't they come and pester you to death?

08:47.700 --> 08:50.160
But now, your main gate is gone,
so you can have some peace.

08:50.240 --> 08:51.759
I don't think they will come
looking for you anymore.

08:51.759 --> 08:52.480
Wei Hao,

08:52.800 --> 08:54.639
I will not let you get away with this.

08:54.920 --> 08:56.470
Then, I'll go blow up the living hall.

08:56.480 --> 08:57.120
Don't.

08:57.720 --> 08:58.519
The hall

08:58.519 --> 09:00.639
has antiques preserved
for over a century.

09:00.639 --> 09:01.279
If you bomb it,

09:01.279 --> 09:02.680
I'm not finished with you!

09:02.720 --> 09:05.040
Then, you should tell them
to come and stop me.

09:06.040 --> 09:07.000
Go stop him.

09:07.000 --> 09:08.600
Stop this unfilial son.

09:09.160 --> 09:09.800
Fine,

09:10.000 --> 09:11.120
I won't bomb it then.

09:11.639 --> 09:13.879
I'll have my aunt
send you ten guan later.

09:13.879 --> 09:14.959
Fix the gate yourself.

09:14.959 --> 09:16.039
One hundred guan!

09:16.039 --> 09:16.960
If it's short by one wen,

09:16.960 --> 09:18.840
I'll send men to tear down
your own main gate.

09:18.840 --> 09:19.559
Bye-bye.

09:33.080 --> 09:34.200
Dead fool.

09:34.559 --> 09:36.879
He only knows how
to bully his own people.

09:36.879 --> 09:37.600
Clan Leader,

09:38.039 --> 09:39.159
what should we do now?

09:39.440 --> 09:40.320
What should we do?

09:40.330 --> 09:41.890
Just go back to whatever you were doing.

09:42.320 --> 09:43.600
Go...

09:47.080 --> 09:49.159
(The brat still has some conscience.)

09:49.320 --> 09:50.919
(He didn't blow up the front hall.)

09:53.137 --> 09:59.312
(Cui Mansion)

10:03.759 --> 10:04.559
This won't do.

10:05.360 --> 10:07.360
We must demand
an explanation from Wei Yuanzhao.

10:08.039 --> 10:08.840
This time,

10:09.279 --> 10:10.960
let's see what Wei Yuanzhao has to say.

10:12.440 --> 10:13.879
Wei Hao has trampled the honor

10:13.879 --> 10:15.440
of our great clans into the dirt.

10:15.440 --> 10:17.960
If Wei Yuanzhao doesn't give me
a satisfactory answer,

10:18.919 --> 10:20.039
I'm not finished with him.

10:20.559 --> 10:21.240
Let's go.

10:22.080 --> 10:22.879
Master,

10:23.440 --> 10:25.679
Wei Yuanzhao's main gate
was also blown up.

10:25.679 --> 10:26.399
What?

10:27.519 --> 10:29.919
He even blew up
the gate of his own clan leader?

10:30.240 --> 10:30.919
Yes.

10:31.159 --> 10:32.660
He's nearly fainting from rage himself.

10:35.759 --> 10:37.399
Send someone to repair the living hall.

10:38.080 --> 10:38.759
Yes.

10:43.080 --> 10:43.970
Regarding this matter,

10:44.600 --> 10:46.679
we cannot let Wei Hao off.

10:48.000 --> 10:49.799
Notify the officials from our clan.

10:50.120 --> 10:51.639
Tell them to continue impeaching him.

10:52.519 --> 10:54.360
Wei Hao is a Marquis
of the current dynasty

10:54.600 --> 10:56.080
and the Emperor's future son-in-law.

10:56.840 --> 10:57.879
If the Emperor

10:58.720 --> 11:01.039
doesn't give us a satisfactory answer,

11:03.320 --> 11:04.679
we will not let this go.

11:14.320 --> 11:15.120
What?

11:15.720 --> 11:17.120
Is it really Wei the Fool?

11:17.120 --> 11:18.000
Yes, Your Majesty.

11:18.390 --> 11:19.440
He blew up the main gates

11:19.440 --> 11:21.279
of the great clans' representatives
in the capital.

11:21.279 --> 11:23.500
He even blew up the main gate
of Wei Yuanzhao's mansion.

11:23.879 --> 11:26.399
It has become
the laughingstock of the capital.

11:27.360 --> 11:28.919
This brat.

11:29.000 --> 11:30.320
Where did he get gunpowder?

11:30.320 --> 11:31.120
Your Majesty,

11:31.559 --> 11:33.080
I am not sure about that.

11:33.440 --> 11:35.799
I suppose he formulated it himself.

11:35.799 --> 11:37.320
He does have a formula.

11:38.039 --> 11:38.759
Your Majesty,

11:39.279 --> 11:40.240
regarding this matter,

11:40.559 --> 11:41.360
the great clans

11:41.960 --> 11:43.519
will certainly impeach Wei Hao.

11:43.639 --> 11:44.840
How should we handle it?

11:44.840 --> 11:45.679
Handle it?

11:46.399 --> 11:47.600
Why handle it at all?

11:49.440 --> 11:50.480
So what if he blew them up?

11:51.360 --> 11:52.720
(He's fine even after that?)

11:53.120 --> 11:55.159
(How much does His Majesty
dote on Wei the Fool?)

11:56.080 --> 11:56.799
Your Majesty,

11:57.080 --> 11:59.399
the censor-in-chief
just sent these over.

11:59.399 --> 12:01.879
They are all petitions
to impeach Marquis Wei.

12:02.120 --> 12:02.799
Leave them there.

12:02.799 --> 12:03.480
Yes.

12:07.000 --> 12:09.519
(Wei Hao blew up
those great clans' main gates.)

12:09.759 --> 12:11.159
(How satisfying.)

12:11.399 --> 12:13.159
(And they want me to punish Wei Hao?)

12:14.159 --> 12:15.240
(This son-in-law of mine)

12:15.279 --> 12:17.519
(did exactly what
I've always wanted to do.)

12:17.519 --> 12:19.279
(Do they think I would
actually punish him?)

12:28.437 --> 12:31.267
♪Everyone says I'm a big silly fool♪

12:31.887 --> 12:35.287
♪When things happen,
I only know how to count on my fingers♪

12:36.057 --> 12:39.007
♪They shake their heads
and say I'm pitiful♪

12:39.347 --> 12:42.047
♪Sigh and walk away♪

12:43.647 --> 12:47.117
♪Little do they know,
I am sharp and bright♪

12:47.117 --> 12:49.347
♪With a heart like a mirror,
I understand the world's♪

12:49.347 --> 12:51.457
♪Colors and darkness♪

12:51.457 --> 12:53.477
♪But I keep my edge hidden♪

12:53.477 --> 12:57.837
♪The day I become famous
is just around the corner♪

12:59.277 --> 13:03.007
♪In the hotpot restaurant,
skewers boil in the broth♪

13:03.277 --> 13:06.877
♪People come and go,
with few worries or troubles♪

13:07.037 --> 13:09.117
♪The clacking of the abacus rings out♪

13:09.117 --> 13:13.907
♪See me differently.
Who dares to challenge me?♪

13:14.127 --> 13:15.747
♪The world mistakes me♪

13:15.747 --> 13:18.087
♪For an ignorant and stubborn fool♪

13:18.157 --> 13:19.347
♪As the storm approaches♪

13:19.347 --> 13:21.747
♪I just shrug and watch with a smile♪

13:21.957 --> 13:23.677
♪This foolish image is convenient♪

13:23.677 --> 13:25.657
♪I use it as a protective shield♪

13:25.827 --> 13:27.577
♪Navigating with ease, I attract♪

13:27.577 --> 13:29.677
♪A lucky star to accompany me♪

13:29.677 --> 13:31.147
♪In a peaceful golden age♪

13:31.147 --> 13:33.377
♪I hold my lady's hand
to watch the world♪

13:33.597 --> 13:34.797
♪Pouring youth and fireworks♪

13:34.797 --> 13:37.317
♪Into a precious glazed cup♪

13:37.447 --> 13:39.157
♪Having experienced life's changes♪

13:39.157 --> 13:40.437
♪And tasted its highs and lows♪

13:40.587 --> 13:42.007
♪My wish has finally come true♪

13:42.007 --> 13:43.047
♪To stay by your side♪

13:43.047 --> 13:44.967
♪In this fleeting world♪

13:45.137 --> 13:48.387
♪We are free and happy♪

13:52.387 --> 13:54.167
♪From a nobody♪

13:54.167 --> 13:56.067
♪To someone now famous♪

13:56.177 --> 13:57.607
♪Ordinary people laugh at me♪

13:57.607 --> 14:00.117
♪But I laugh at how
they cannot see through it all♪

14:00.217 --> 14:01.797
♪Let others plot and scheme♪

14:01.797 --> 14:03.867
♪I will keep my heart unchanged♪

14:04.077 --> 14:05.757
♪In this vast world♪

14:05.757 --> 14:07.757
♪I find my own leisurely freedom♪

14:07.907 --> 14:10.117
♪The world is bustling,
and things constantly change♪

14:10.117 --> 14:11.707
♪Everything ends eventually♪

14:11.797 --> 14:13.297
♪All that remains before my eyes♪

14:13.297 --> 14:15.697
♪Is this street wandering,
still tinged with pity♪

14:15.697 --> 14:17.407
♪No matter how time flies♪

14:17.407 --> 14:18.567
♪Even if the falling snow♪

14:18.567 --> 14:20.197
♪Dyes the hair at our temples white♪

14:20.197 --> 14:21.237
♪All I want now♪

14:21.237 --> 14:23.337
♪Is to pray for
my lady's peace and safety♪

14:23.337 --> 14:26.597
♪Year after year♪
